********************************************************************************
*********************************Floquet Input*********************************
********************************************************************************
30                                     ! Max order of the Fourier series
20.00000000                             ! Frequency of the driving field (GHz)
-------------------------------Electrode set-up -------------------------------
0.00200000                              ! Gamma_R_0 (meV)
0.00010000                              ! Gamma_L_0 (meV)
(0.00000000,0.00000000)                 ! A_R
(0.00000000,0.00000000)                 ! A_L
0.00000000                              ! Phase of the driving field (radians)
1000.00000000                            ! Cutoff for integral Lambshift (meV)
(0.00200000,0.00000000)                 ! Broadening of Green's function (meV)
500000                                  ! Number of points for I11 and I21
1                                       ! Number of orbital, 1 will not use any Diego Lehman coeff
--------------------Bias, temperature, and spin polarization--------------------
0                                       ! 0 EF closer to muR if gR>>gL, 1 EF to muL, 2 Ef at mu with gamma>> (UNUSED)
0.00000000                             ! Right elctrode bias (mV)
-30.00000000                            ! Left electrode bias (mV)
0.50000000                              ! Temperature (K)
0.00000000                              ! Right electrode spin polarization
0.50000000                              ! Left electrode spin polarization
0                                       ! Current measurement: 0 is left and 1 is right electrode
0
0
--------------------------------Bessel function--------------------------------
0.00000000                              ! B_R strengt of the time depenndet pulse for right electrode
5.00000000                              ! B_L strengt of the time depenndet pulse for left electrode
3                                     ! Max order of Bessel function in both directions
80
-------------------------------------Output-------------------------------------
.true.                                  ! Write populations
.true.                                  ! Write coherences
.true.                                  ! Write spin
--------------------------------------Misc--------------------------------------
.false.                                 ! Redimension the Hamiltonian
4                                       ! Redimension number - must include empty states for non-zero current
